{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a17b9d2e-0c41-4f8a-9b22-autotrader0001",
    "name": "AutoTrader",
    "description": "AutoTrader HTTP surfaces.\n\n- **Webhook ingress** (autotrader/signals/webhook.py, default 127.0.0.1:8799): authenticated, enqueue-only. POST /webhook/sweep needs X-Webhook-Token (shared secret) AND X-Webhook-Signature = 'sha256=' + HMAC-SHA256(secret, raw body). 'signed' requests compute that automatically via a CryptoJS pre-request script.\n- **Dashboard** (dashboard/server.py, default 127.0.0.1:8787): read-only GETs, gated on OpenD readiness (503 until ready).\n\nSet `webhook_secret` in the AutoTrader environment (== AUTOTRADER_WEBHOOK_SECRET).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Webhook ingress",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health \u2014 GET /healthz",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('status ok', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('ok'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{webhook_base_url}}/healthz",
              "host": [
                "{{webhook_base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "healthz"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Submit sweep \u2014 signed (202)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Auto-sign the webhook request: X-Webhook-Token + HMAC-SHA256 of the RAW body.",
                  "// Server (autotrader/signals/webhook.py) compares the signature constant-time over",
                  "// the exact bytes it receives, so we hash the variable-resolved body.",
                  "const secret = pm.environment.get('webhook_secret') || pm.collectionVariables.get('webhook_secret') || '';",
                  "if (!secret) { console.warn('webhook_secret is empty -- set it in the AutoTrader environment'); }",
                  "const raw  = (pm.request.body && pm.request.body.raw) ? pm.request.body.raw : '';",
                  "const body = pm.variables.replaceIn(raw);",
                  "const sig  = 'sha256=' + CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(body, secret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
                  "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Webhook-Token', value: secret });",
                  "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Webhook-Signature', value: sig });"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('202 Accepted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "pm.test('accepted + echoes signal count', () => {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(j.status).to.eql('accepted');",
                  "  pm.expect(j.signals).to.be.a('number');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"routine_id\": \"routine-20260615-1134-20219d\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-15T11:34:00\",\n  \"signal_changes\": [\n    {\n      \"ticker\": \"US.DIVO\",\n      \"direction\": \"UP\",\n      \"transition\": [\n        \"HOLD\",\n        \"BUY\"\n      ],\n      \"points_delta\": 7,\n      \"driver\": \"ticker sweep (score 71)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ticker\": \"CA.VDY\",\n      \"direction\": \"UP\",\n      \"transition\": [\n        \"HOLD\",\n        \"BUY\"\n      ],\n      \"points_delta\": 8,\n      \"driver\": \"ticker sweep (score 77)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ticker\": \"US.YNVDA\",\n      \"direction\": \"DOWN\",\n      \"transition\": [\n        \"CAUTION\",\n        \"AVOID\"\n      ],\n      \"points_delta\": -10,\n      \"driver\": \"ticker sweep (score 22)\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"hard_stops\": {},\n  \"catalysts\": []\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{webhook_base_url}}/webhook/sweep",
              "host": [
                "{{webhook_base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "webhook",
                "sweep"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Canonical RoutineSignalPayload. Pre-request script computes the HMAC signature."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Submit sweep \u2014 raw producer dialect, expect 400",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Auto-sign the webhook request: X-Webhook-Token + HMAC-SHA256 of the RAW body.",
                  "// Server (autotrader/signals/webhook.py) compares the signature constant-time over",
                  "// the exact bytes it receives, so we hash the variable-resolved body.",
                  "const secret = pm.environment.get('webhook_secret') || pm.collectionVariables.get('webhook_secret') || '';",
                  "if (!secret) { console.warn('webhook_secret is empty -- set it in the AutoTrader environment'); }",
                  "const raw  = (pm.request.body && pm.request.body.raw) ? pm.request.body.raw : '';",
                  "const body = pm.variables.replaceIn(raw);",
                  "const sig  = 'sha256=' + CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(body, secret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
                  "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Webhook-Token', value: secret });",
                  "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Webhook-Signature', value: sig });"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Correctly signed (auth passes) but the body is the producer's native ticker-sweep",
                  "// dialect (run_id/sweep_date/composite_score/upgrade), which the strict schema rejects.",
                  "// Convert with `python3 -m autotrader.signals.routine_adapter` before sending.",
                  "pm.test('400 invalid payload', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "pm.test('error is invalid payload', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql('invalid payload'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"run_id\": \"routine-20260615-1134-20219d\",\n  \"sweep_date\": \"2026-06-15\",\n  \"ticker_count\": 14,\n  \"signal_changes\": [\n    {\n      \"ticker\": \"DIVO\",\n      \"from_signal\": \"HOLD\",\n      \"to_signal\": \"BUY\",\n      \"composite_score\": 71,\n      \"price\": 45.35,\n      \"direction\": \"upgrade\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ticker\": \"VDY\",\n      \"from_signal\": \"HOLD\",\n      \"to_signal\": \"BUY\",\n      \"composite_score\": 77,\n      \"price\": 74.55,\n      \"direction\": \"upgrade\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ticker\": \"YNVDA\",\n      \"from_signal\": \"CAUTION\",\n      \"to_signal\": \"AVOID\",\n      \"composite_score\": 22,\n      \"price\": 14.15,\n      \"direction\": \"downgrade\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{webhook_base_url}}/webhook/sweep",
              "host": [
                "{{webhook_base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "webhook",
                "sweep"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
